{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "e8c85d02-5396-86ee-ba0d-ea9f31f273cc",
  "created_at": "2026-01-11T13:30:33-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Dulce Varela",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T13:27:59-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Lorraine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T13:28:02-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes, hello. Um, I know City Hall is closed today, it's Sunday, so I wasn't sure I'd get anybody. Is this the right number for a tree?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T13:28:12-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is. The storm line is open for exactly this. What's going on with the tree?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T13:28:18-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So, hmm, let me see. There's a big tree down, well, not totally down, it's tipped over. The roots pulled right up out of the ground, there's a whole wall of dirt sticking up. That was from the coastal storm yesterday, the one Friday into Saturday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T13:28:34-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, the roots pulled up and it tipped over. Where is this tree, hon? What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T13:28:41-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "239 Bacheller Street. In the Fifth Ward. It's right at the edge of the sidewalk, so, no, wait, actually it's partly on the sidewalk and, um, leaning toward the wires, I think. I'm not sure whose tree it is, honestly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T13:28:55-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "239 Bacheller. Leaning toward the wires, partly over the sidewalk. Is anyone hurt, or is it touching the lines?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T13:29:02-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, nobody's hurt. I don't think it's touching them, but it's close. I'm a little nervous about it, I bike to work year round so I'm out there every morning, I've got my heavy gloves on right now, I just came in from looking at it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T13:29:18-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, good that you're keeping clear of it. So your question is who handles it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T13:29:24-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Who do I call, the city, or the owner, or the electric company? Hmm, or all of them? I don't want to call the wrong one and have it sit there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T13:29:36-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. If it's a city street tree or in the public right of way, that's us, and I'll take the report now. If it's on private property, it's usually the owner's responsibility. And anything touching or near the power lines, you'd also call the utility, they deal with the lines themselves. I'd say stay away from it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T13:29:56-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Hmm. So I should call the utility too, if it's close to the wires."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T13:30:02-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I'd do that, and I'll put this in for our crew to look at and figure out whose tree it is. Can I get a number for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T13:30:13-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, it's 401-555-0191."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T13:30:15-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0191, and that's Dulce?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T13:30:17-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Dulce Varela, yes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T13:30:19-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, Dulce. Tree down at 239 Bacheller, roots pulled up, leaning toward the wires. Someone will check it out. Crews are busy after a storm, so it may take a bit."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T13:30:30-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that's fine. Thank you, Lorraine."
    }
  ],
